diff --git a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
index f8fc61c7a..45429b656 100644
--- a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
+++ b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
@@ -338,7 +338,7 @@ Note: New panels added or modified mostly not mentioned here for concision. See
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5522+) **Beautified** the **Policy Advisor**: enlarge **top panels text** so **long civic names don't overflow**. **Remove multiline nationality** information which was **uninfomative** and **crowded vertically** in the **Religions tab** and the **Corporations tab**; use more precise and compact `Leader (ID)` and `HQ (ID)` **one-liner instead** (**ID** also handles **one leader name being used by several players**); **increase row spacing** (now **unified** (was crowded)). **Remove multiline wrapped bonuses** splitting logic in the **Corporations tab**: use one natural comma-separated line (bonuses row height reduced/standardized) since there is enough space after expanding the Policy Advisor and it is more readable. Also add **new rows** (**Bonuses Generated**, **Yields Generated**), and add **first column descriptions** for rows (as of now `Built By:`, `Consumes:`, `Generates:`, `Generates 2:`). Add a **Great Person icon** in `Built By:` row. Change in [CvPolicyAdvisorScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvPolicyAdvisorScreen.py).
 - **Foreign Advisor**: refined its tabs so they can display **up to 12 players**. Notably renamed the Active tab to **Treaties** tab (no longer shows redundant bonuses (since their deal can be cancelled from the bonuses tab)), and **beautified** it with **icons**. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5516+) Always use the unified **table-style info layout** (`drawInfoImproved`) for the Info Tab for stable column behavior: the old hardcoded text spacing (`drawInfoOriginal`) did not **scale with upscaled font text** nor **adjust depending on advisor screen size**. Plus the improved layout has additional **information** like general or specific **colored leader attitude text** related to civic/religion choices (e.g., `[-2]` or `[+1]`). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5518+) **Beautified** the **Espionage Tab** similarly; notably **removed redundant Espionage slider** now that commerce sliders are on the right side of main interface in map view, and **improved text spacing** that **was colliding or overflowing** beyond its panel, and **moved + - buttons under the leader icon** where there is more room and it is more intuitive and easier to click it.
 - Added **"Willing to become vassal"** and **"Vassal"** **icons** in the Foreign Advisor's Glance tab in the human player's row, to help avoid the need to tediously check these up through other screens, in [CvForeignAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvForeignAdvisor.py), and in [CvDLLWidgetData.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvDLLWidgetData.cpp) for the corresponding **tooltip** (on hover). See ["Willing to become a vassal" and "vassal" icons](/README.md#willing-to-become-a-vassal-and-vassal-icons-in-foreign-advisors-glance-tab).
-- Reworked the **Military Advisor** in [CvMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMilitaryAdvisor.py) now with Unit Combat and Units **icons**.
+- Reworked the **Military Advisor** in [CvMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMilitaryAdvisor.py) now with Unit Combat and Units **icons**. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5530+) Note: **icon size** is **increased** at **higher resolutions** (e.g., from 24 to 32 if resolution height >= 1440). Note 2: as of now the [CvBUGMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvBUGMilitaryAdvisor.py) is not supported.
 - Similarly Beautified and Enhanced the **Technology Advisor** in [CvTechChooser.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvTechChooser.py) so it uses more of the screen while still preserving key information. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5519+) Players can **optionally** set an **alternative lower right space for scoreboard** on **lower game resolutions** (e.g., 1920*1080) so that an **extra column or more is visible** in the technology advisor, and an **alternative top space space** for **advisor buttons** (in map view) because this alternative right space may cover these advisor buttons. **Boldened title** for consistency. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5520+) See also [KI#114](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#114---fixed-base-advciv-bug-of-tech-advisor-on-save-load-initially-shown-current-tech-missing-turns-left-timer-until-another-tech-is-clicked).
 - **Inverted BUG Options** for the **Technology Advisor** and the **Religion Advisor** so they are more accessible. They are now **enabled as a default**, and ticking their box disables them. Rewrote their text for clarity (e.g. "GP Research" -> **"Hide bulbing indicators"**). See [Inverted BUG options](/README.md#inverted-bug-options).
 - Did a similar rework of the **Info Screen** in [CvInfoScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvInfoScreen.py); in particular in **Top 5 Cities** we now use a multilist to display more wonders in a prettier way, and in the **Wonders** tab we now **show the Wonders' Buttons** (i.e. icons) in the first column (**click to move to city** mechanic is moved to the City column instead); the **Statistics** tab now also shows buttons (plus **change default ordering** from alphabetical to **from most to least Built/Current** (avoids tedious manual user ordering each time)), and the **Graph** Tab and possibly other tabs also show buttons (e.g., **leader icons before text**, **emojis**). Also added other information (e.g., turn numbers in the Graph tab).

